# Cloudflare Pages redirects: path based only (https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/).
#
# Other domains and www -> https://openworldclock.com cannot live here: Pages does not support domain-level lines
# such as "freewindowsworldclock.com/* https://openworldclock.com/:splat 301". They are an account Bulk Redirect
# list instead (cloudflare/bulk-redirects.csv, steps in cloudflare/README.md), which runs before this file:
#   freewindowsworldclock.com, www.freewindowsworldclock.com  -> https://openworldclock.com (path and query kept)
#   worldclock.download, www.worldclock.download              -> https://openworldclock.com (path and query kept)
#   www.openworldclock.com                                    -> https://openworldclock.com (path and query kept)
#   open-world-clock.pages.dev                                -> https://openworldclock.com (previews untouched)
#
# 404: a path with no file gets 404.html with a real 404 status automatically. Do not add a "/*" catch-all.
# Clean URLs: Pages serves /privacy from privacy.html and 308s /privacy.html to /privacy by itself.

/privacy-policy  /privacy     301
/downloads       /download    301
/get             /download    301
/converter       /time-zone-converter  301
/planner         /meeting-planner      301
/map             /world-map            301
# /download, /faq, /features, /time-zone-converter, /meeting-planner, /world-map and
# /windows-clock-alternative are real pages, so they must not redirect.

# /app/ is the live app inside the home page's hero (an iframe), so it must not redirect here: a rule would break the
# frame. Opened on its own, its script sends the visitor to / with the hash (web/shim.js).

# This folder's README is for maintainers, not visitors.
/README.md       /            301

# RFC 9116 allows the legacy top-level path to redirect to the real file.
/security.txt    /.well-known/security.txt  301

# The site publishes HTML pages only; old markdown URLs go to their pages.
/index.md        /            301
/index.html.md   /            301
/features.md     /features    301
/download.md     /download    301
/faq.md          /faq         301
/privacy.md      /privacy     301
/privacy.html.md /privacy     301
